<title>USA: RAC Financial to buy Western Interstate.</title>
<headline>RAC Financial to buy Western Interstate.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>RAC Financial Group Inc said on Thursday it agreed to buy Western Interstate Bancorp in an exchange of stock.</p>
<p>Western is the parent company of Citizens Thrift and Loan Association of Tustin, Calif., which has assets of $125.1 million.</p>
<p>RAC is a consumer finance company that operates under the name FIRSTPLUS.</p>
<p>Further financial details of the transaction were not immediately available from the company.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
